import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 592 | Dual-Track Linkage · Path D | Acceleration-Domain Deduction of Human-Race Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Ring","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 592 | Dual-Track Linkage · Path D | Acceleration-Domain Deduction of Human-Race Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Ring","no":592,"module":3,"tags":["Dual-Track Linkage","Path D","Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Ring","Acceleration-Domain Deduction","Lin Hao"],"related":["501-Dual-Track Time Domain Overview","591-Lin Hao Path-D Practice","11-Deduction Iteration System Details"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0592_模块3-双轨联动-D路线魂环加速推演.md","filePath":"en/0592_模块3-双轨联动-D路线魂环加速推演.md"}'),r={name:"en/0592_模块3-双轨联动-D路线魂环加速推演.md"};function o(s,e,l,c,d,h){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-592-dual-track-linkage-·-path-d-acceleration-domain-deduction-of-human-race-artificial-dao-principle-spirit-ring" tabindex="-1">Entry 592 | Dual-Track Linkage · Path D | Acceleration-Domain Deduction of Human-Race Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Ring <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-592-dual-track-linkage-·-path-d-acceleration-domain-deduction-of-human-race-artificial-dao-principle-spirit-ring" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 592 | Dual-Track Linkage · Path D | Acceleration-Domain Deduction of Human-Race Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Ring&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark library: Entries 501, 591; Benchmark base: Document 11</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-an-acceleration-domain-solution-to-a-technical-problem" tabindex="-1">Introduction: an acceleration-domain solution to a technical problem <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-an-acceleration-domain-solution-to-a-technical-problem" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: an acceleration-domain solution to a technical problem&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Entry 591 spoke of Lin Hao&#39;s overall practice in the dual-track time domain; this entry focuses on its most technical link: <strong>Path D · human-race artificial Dao-Principle spirit ring&#39;s deduction process in the Origin Acceleration Domain</strong>. This is the key step turning anti-predation axiom from moral claim into engineering solution — since we do not swallow spirit beasts&#39; rings, where do rings come from? The answer: deduce them in the acceleration domain.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this technical deduction become hard constraints: anti-predation axiom requires artificial rings zero-kill, zero-swallow; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires deduction schemes public to the human race and even Myriad Ranks; collective ascension axiom requires deduction results become public goods; causal self-discipline axiom requires deduction not disturb Douluo plane&#39;s native causality; law-first axiom requires deduction strictly obey Douluo plane&#39;s laws, no retcon. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-what-problem-artificial-dao-principle-spirit-rings-must-solve" tabindex="-1">I. What Problem Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Rings Must Solve <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-problem-artificial-dao-principle-spirit-rings-must-solve" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What Problem Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Rings Must Solve&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In Douluo&#39;s native system, spirit rings come from spirit beasts&#39; post-death residue, essentially &quot;kill one being to take its origin.&quot; Path D must replace it, solving three technical problems:</p><ol><li><strong>The ring&#39;s law structure</strong>: artificial rings must reproduce natural rings&#39; law-bearing capacity;</li><li><strong>Human-ring compatibility</strong>: artificial rings must not conflict with the cultivator&#39;s body;</li><li><strong>The ring&#39;s energy source</strong>: cannot rely on killing spirit beasts, must come from incremental development.</li></ol><p>These three problems at real flow might take centuries to trial-and-error one by one. The Origin Acceleration Domain compresses them into decades of accelerated time.</p><h2 id="ii-three-phases-of-acceleration-domain-deduction" tabindex="-1">II. Three Phases of Acceleration-Domain Deduction <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-three-phases-of-acceleration-domain-deduction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Three Phases of Acceleration-Domain Deduction&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Phase</th><th>Flow</th><th>Core Task</th><th>Output</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Law-Structure Reverse-Engineering</td><td>1000×</td><td>In acceleration domain analyze natural ring&#39;s law structure</td><td>Ring structure model</td></tr><tr><td>Artificial-Scheme Design</td><td>500×</td><td>Based on structure model design artificial ring schemes</td><td>Multiple candidate schemes</td></tr><tr><td>Isolated-Space Simulation</td><td>200×</td><td>In isolated space simulate artificial ring operation</td><td>Simulation verification report</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This three-phase strictly follows Document 11&#39;s deduction iteration system: first reverse-engineer the natural object, then design the artificial object, then simulate in isolated space. The acceleration domain here is used on the cutting edge — because &quot;analysis&quot; and &quot;simulation&quot; are both information-processing tasks, naturally suited to high flow.</p><h2 id="iii-the-deduction-result-s-anti-predation-attributes" tabindex="-1">III. The Deduction Result&#39;s Anti-Predation Attributes <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-deduction-result-s-anti-predation-attributes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Deduction Result&#39;s Anti-Predation Attributes&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Artificial Dao-Principle spirit ring schemes produced by acceleration-domain deduction, by design, have three anti-predation attributes:</p><ul><li><strong>Zero-kill</strong>: the ring&#39;s energy comes from environmental incremental development, kills no spirit beast;</li><li><strong>Zero-swallow</strong>: the ring symbiotically merges with the cultivator, does not swallow others&#39; origin;</li><li><strong>Zero-monopoly</strong>: the scheme is public through the Alaya Network to all human race, anyone may use.</li></ul><p>These three attributes are anti-predation axiom&#39;s direct engineering compilation. Path D is not &quot;we also make rings,&quot; but &quot;we make a kind of ring that fundamentally does not plunder.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-time-ledger-comparison-with-the-native-predatory-system" tabindex="-1">IV. Time-Ledger Comparison with the Native Predatory System <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-time-ledger-comparison-with-the-native-predatory-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Time-Ledger Comparison with the Native Predatory System&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Native Kill-Ring Path</th><th>Path-D Artificial Ring</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ring Source</td><td>Kill spirit beasts</td><td>Acceleration-domain deduction</td></tr><tr><td>Entry Time</td><td>Decades (must hunt)</td><td>Years (scheme mature)</td></tr><tr><td>Moral Cost</td><td>One life per ring</td><td>Zero</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge Ownership</td><td>Sect secret</td><td>Alaya public</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank Impact</td><td>Spirit-beast extinction risk</td><td>Spirit-beast coexistence</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This comparison table shows: Path D is not only morally correct, but also more cost-effective on the time ledger — because the acceleration domain one-time amortizes R&amp;D cost over all users, while the native path makes every cultivator re-pay the killing cost once.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: acceleration domain one-time deduces schemes, avoiding every cultivator repeating trial-and-error</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: zero-kill, zero-swallow, zero-monopoly, engineeringly seals off plunder</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Douluo&#39;s native kills spirit beasts for rings; Path D deduces rings in acceleration domain</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: scheme public to all human race and Myriad Ranks willing to walk Path D</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: deduction models, candidate schemes, simulation reports all public; this is the technical segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-ethical-boundaries-of-artificial-dao-principle-spirit-rings" tabindex="-1">VI. Ethical Boundaries of Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Rings <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-ethical-boundaries-of-artificial-dao-principle-spirit-rings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Ethical Boundaries of Artificial Dao-Principle Spirit Rings&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Though artificial rings are zero-kill, the Alaya Network still sets ethical boundaries for them: must not manufacture rings exceeding the human race&#39;s current tolerance, must not forcibly promote to un-applied civilizations, must not use ring technology to control beings. These boundaries are written into scheme documents, public together with the technology. The more powerful the technology, the clearer the ethical boundaries must be — this is causal self-discipline axiom&#39;s expression in technical engineering. Any attempt to use artificial rings to control beings will be immediately stopped by the Anchor Supervisory Committee.</p><h2 id="vii-phased-rollout-of-artificial-rings" tabindex="-1">VII. Phased Rollout of Artificial Rings <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-phased-rollout-of-artificial-rings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Phased Rollout of Artificial Rings&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Path-D artificial Dao-Principle spirit rings are not one-time fully promoted, but phased: first batch only tested among human volunteers, verifying safety; second batch expanded to Myriad-Rank clans applying to join; third batch opened to all beings willing to walk Path D. Phased rollout keeps technical risk controllable, each batch&#39;s feedback used to improve the next. This engineering rhythm itself embodies dual-track time-domain thought — fast R&amp;D, slow promotion, stable landing.</p><h2 id="viii-user-feedback-loop-for-artificial-rings" tabindex="-1">VIII. User Feedback Loop for Artificial Rings <a class="header-anchor" href="#viii-user-feedback-loop-for-artificial-rings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VIII. User Feedback Loop for Artificial Rings&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Each rolled-out batch of artificial rings comes with a user feedback channel: users encountering any problem during use may directly feedback to the acceleration-domain R&amp;D team. Feedback is classified and processed, urgent issues immediately hot-fixed, non-urgent issues enter next-version planning. This user feedback loop makes artificial rings better and better with use, and makes users feel they are co-builders of the technology.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Path D&#39;s acceleration-domain deduction proves: anti-predation is not asceticism, but a more efficient engineering choice. <strong>Artificial Dao-Principle spirit rings deduced over decades in the acceleration domain are faster, cleaner, more Myriad-Rank-owned than killing spirit beasts over centuries in reality.</strong> This is the dual-track time domain&#39;s best answer to anti-predation axiom.</p><p>In the end, the dual-track linkage · Path-D spirit-ring acceleration deduction described in this entry is no isolated case — it runs within Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s overall coordinates.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./591_模块3-双轨联动-林昊D路线实践.html">591-Lin Hao Path-D Practice</a> · <a href="./501_模块3-双轨时间域总论.html">501-Dual-Track Time Domain Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">11-Deduction Iteration System Details</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const p=i(r,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
